.SH NAME
git-work-issue-comment-new - Add a new comment to an issue


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work issue comment new ISSUE_ID BODY|- [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a comment to an issue, its body given as the argument or on standard
input. The new comment's id is printed, and nothing else.
ISSUE_ID is an id prefix or an alias.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for new


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-issue-comment(1)\fP
